akes when handling tools, modules, or personal protective equipment can quickly turn into dangerous moments. Learn to recognize dangers early on and act safely.\n\nTranslated with DeepL.com (free version)", "short_description": "Experience work safety in wood construction virtually and realistically: recognize typical risks, react correctly\u2014without any risk of injury. Learn how to avoid mistakes and use tools and modules safely."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.swiss-safety-vr.ch/_files/ugd/5661b7_b76ecd45a2924048b414f17240a090ca.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Suva", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.swiss-safety-vr.ch/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["de", "it"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "33358594297061067"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1992441621573043"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1992441621573043"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1763637540, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1992441621573043"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "40168444469409315", "version": "2026.10.rc1"}, "id": "24830309259928001", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes":